--- !u!114 &1993290569
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1993290567}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7dde1faf6ac8848188b51dc197e8f2fe, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SceneContextObject
  objectId: tavern
  displayName: The Old Tavern
  objectType: Building
  description: The village tavern, a warm and crowded room at the center of daily
    life and the place where the village really gathers. Locals come to drink, eat,
    and argue, travelers stop to rest and trade news from the road, and merchants
    settle their deals over a table. Families sometimes bring their quarrels here,
    and on quiet nights the old village stories are told again by the fire. Mira runs
    the place and hears almost every rumor first, reading who is calm, who is tense,
    and who is hiding something. When people are frightened or worried, the talk grows
    quieter and more careful.
  tags:
  - tavern
  - social
  - gathering
  - rumors
  - news
  - travelers
  - merchants
  - stories
  - disputes
  - mira
  stateFacts:
  - Mira runs the tavern and usually hears rumors first
  - Locals, travelers, and merchants gather here every day
  - Travelers bring news and stories from the road
  - Deals are made and family quarrels are aired here
  - Old village stories are retold by the fire
  - When people are worried the talk grows quiet and careful
